# --- Quarto build state and rendered output ---
/.quarto/
/_book/
/*_cache/
/*_files/
*.rmarkdown
*.knit.md

# NOTE: /_freeze/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Frozen computation results are
# committed so the GitHub Action can render the book without an R toolchain,
# without compiling rioja, and without calling the Neotoma API.

# --- R ---
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj

# --- editors ---
.vscode/
.Rproj.user/

# --- Claude Code working context (local only, not shared with co-authors) ---
/.notes/
/CLAUDE.md
